			[ 'Do HMO tenants have to clean their own rooms?', 'Yes. Tenants are responsible for keeping their own rooms clean and returning them in the condition recorded at check-in, allowing for fair wear and tear.' ],
			[ 'Can I charge HMO tenants a separate cleaning fee?', 'In England, the Tenant Fees Act 2019 stops landlords charging tenants separate fees for things like cleaning. Many HMO landlords include the cost of regular communal cleaning within the rent instead.' ],
